Third-party code
----------------

The Python package has no runtime dependency. The optional extra "jwt"
installs "cryptography" (Apache-2.0 or BSD-3-Clause) through pip. The ports use
only their language's standard library; ports/rust/src/sha256.rs and the JSON
readers of the Rust, Java and C# ports are shared with the SmartSwitch ports
of the same authors.
